    "name":  "Tracklights  Rail  2 meters REINFORCED - Single-phase",
    "reference":  "CFM2000716-BK",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSINGLE-PHASE \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eREINFORCED  ONE METRE\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eRAIL\u003c/strong\u003e compatible with all our LED tracklight.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAvailable in \u003cstrong\u003eblack\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003ewhite\u003c/strong\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e2-Meter REINFORCED Single-Phase Track for LED Spotlights\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eBecause this track\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eruns on a single circuit, switching on the light turns on all of the\u0026nbsp;spotlights\u0026nbsp;at once, with no option to dim them individually. This product is designed to work with our\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eSingle-Phase LED spotlights\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eIt is built with a\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ereinforced\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;structure to guarantee its strength. It includes an\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eend cap\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;at one end and, at the other, the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003epower feed\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003ethat connects directly to the mains. We also offer a range of\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;accessories\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eso you can design your lighting layout to suit your needs.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003ePerfect for\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003elighting\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;and decorating\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eretail spaces.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUses of the\u0026nbsp;Reinforced Single-Phase Track\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eRetail stores\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eMuseums\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eGalleries\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eWindow displays\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eOffices\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eDisplay cabinets\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eAt FactorLED we guarantee that our products carry a QUALITY warranty and provide all the elements required for WHOLESALE DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or SALE, including the datasheet for every LED product.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
